          "turns": [
            {
              "id": "turn:8",
              "speaker": "B",
              "text": "Oh, hello! Sorry, I didn't realize anyone was nearby. I was just... well, I was thinking about the inventory levels. No problem at all, I can just check the logs if you need me to! Actually, since I'm already looking at the stock, would you mind if I asked your opinion on whether we should focus on'",
