          "expiresAtMs": 1788912004001,
          "turns": [
            {
              "id": "turn:20",
              "speaker": "D",
              "text": "In principle, maintaining a predictable routine is the most effective way to ensure long-term stability. I am currently reviewing the dock status to ensure everything remains within standard parameters. Halim, have you finalized the work roster for the upcoming shift?",
              "atMs": 1788825604001
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "conversation:25",
          "participants": [
            "E",
            "F"
          ],
          "status": "open",
          "nextSpeaker": "E",
          "expiresAtMs": 1788912005001,
          "turns": [
            {
              "id": "turn:26",
              "speaker": "E",
              "text": "Halim, I have a moment before the next cycle begins. I've been looking over the current roster and the allocation of duties. Are there any discrepancies in the recent shifts that you've noticed, or are we proceeding as planned?",
              "atMs": 1788825605001
            },
            {
              "id": "turn:31",
              "speaker": "F",
              "text": "Discrepancies? Only if you count the way the light hits the dust in the lower shafts—makes everything look like a Renaissance painting, though I suspect Caravaggio would have found our lighting quite inadequate. But seriously, Edda, the roster seems to be holding, though I've always thought the way'",
